# Copy to .env.local and fill in what you have. Everything is optional: the app runs fully without any key.

# Recommended (free tier): Google Gemini — one key gives accurate voice transcription that handles
# Urdu/English mixing, much better receipt reading, and story understanding. Get it at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash

# Alternative for voice only: OpenAI gpt-4o-transcribe.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: use Claude to read receipts (vision) and interpret stories. Without it, Wusool uses
# Tesseract OCR (local) and a deterministic rule-based interpreter. Claude never does the maths.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: base URL used inside message links (e.g. your LAN address so links open on phones,
# or an https tunnel URL). Defaults to http://localhost:3000.
# WUSOOL_PUBLIC_URL=http://192.168.1.20:3000

# Optional: where the SQLite database and uploads live. Defaults to ./.data
# WUSOOL_DATA_DIR=

# WhatsApp Business Platform: NOT implemented as a live integration in this prototype.
# Setting these only flips the capability label; messages remain simulated in-app.
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
